# The lease (module/hold_lease_sim.c): word 2's bit 34; an app before #847 (no lease) keeps its
# holds through silence; a 30 s lease, bad leases answer 5; a live app answers the asks and keeps
# both holds, other traffic renews without asks; a killed app gets two asks and both holds lapse
# at 30 s (the art key steps on the board, the knob is the volume key); the next report hears of
# it and the holds come back; nothing held asks nothing; D7 15 00 and a link drop end the lease.
/^lease: /p
/^hostlink: rx D7 95/p
/^hostlink: rx D7 8D/p
/^hostlink: rx D7 94/p
s/.*hid_listener_keycode/kp/p
